@DulceRelax.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5082

### OpenAPI document (Development)
GET {{DulceRelax.API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Protected endpoint: returns 401 without a token
GET {{DulceRelax.API_HostAddress}}/api/masaje
Accept: application/json

### Sign in
POST {{DulceRelax.API_HostAddress}}/api/usuario/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "<password>"
}
